---
/**
 * Market — Economics-lens concept at Collective scale.
 * The Space in which Identities meet for economic interests.
 * Keep inline tags on one line with outer spaces (Astro whitespace).
 * No em-dashes in public copy.
 */
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Market | Identity Engineering">
	<main class="min-h-screen">
		<section class="min-h-[50vh] flex flex-col justify-center pt-28 pb-16 border-b border-white/10">
			<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-8">
				<div class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[4px] text-white/40 mb-6">
					Economics lens · Collective Identity
				</div>
				<h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tighter leading-[0.95] mb-6 text-white">
					Market
				</h1>
				<p class="text-xl text-white/50 font-light leading-relaxed mb-6">
					The Space in which Identities meet for economic interests.
					Emergent allocation field under Ownership and Exchange.
				</p>
				<div class="rounded-2xl border border-amber-500/20 bg-amber-500/[0.04] p-4">
					<p class="text-sm text-white/65 leading-relaxed">
						<strong class="text-white/80">Status:</strong> Core concept under the Economics lens.
						Analogy, not isomorphism. Not a platform product by default.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="px-8 py-16 border-b border-white/10">
			<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-6 text-white/60 leading-relaxed">
				<div class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[4px] text-white/40">Definition</div>
				<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white">Where many Exchanges cohere.</h2>
				<p>
					<strong class="text-white/85">Market</strong> is the Space in which multiple Ownership-bearing Identities perform Exchange under relative Prices.
					Allocation emerges from repeated, membrane-bound transfers. It is not centrally planned, and it is not identical with any single platform.
				</p>
				<p>
					Under the Economics lens, Market sits on the Collective scale.
					Interactive Exchange and Price can occur pairwise.
					Market is what appears when enough Identities stay coupled in a shared field of economic interest so that Prices become discoverable and Competition and Specialization can emerge.
				</p>
				<p>
					The telos remains collective causal entropy under recognizable individual trajectories.
					Member Ownership is not erased by the field.
				</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="px-8 py-16 border-b border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02]">
			<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-8">
				<div class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[4px] text-white/40">What Market is</div>
				<ul class="space-y-5 text-lg text-white/60 leading-relaxed">
					<li class="border-l border-white/15 pl-5">
						<strong class="text-white/85">Allocation Space:</strong> the field where economic interests meet under Ownership and Exchange.
					</li>
					<li class="border-l border-white/15 pl-5">
						<strong class="text-white/85">Emergent, not designed as monopoly:</strong> coherence of Prices and roles can arise without a single controller of all claims.
					</li>
					<li class="border-l border-white/15 pl-5">
						<strong class="text-white/85">Membrane-compatible:</strong> Space rules, grants, and residual levers still bind every transfer inside it.
					</li>
					<li class="border-l border-white/15 pl-5">
						<strong class="text-white/85">Precondition of Competition and Specialization:</strong> only when alternatives and pressure exist do roles and division of labor stabilize.
					</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="px-8 py-16 border-b border-white/10">
			<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-8">
				<div class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[4px] text-white/40">What Market is not</div>
				<ul class="space-y-5 text-lg text-white/60 leading-relaxed">
					<li class="border-l border-rose-400/30 pl-5">
						<strong class="text-white/85">Not the platform itself.</strong>
						A product can host a Market; it is not automatically the Market.
					</li>
					<li class="border-l border-rose-400/30 pl-5">
						<strong class="text-white/85">Not ownership of participants.</strong>
						Full possession of member Stems remains excluded.
					</li>
					<li class="border-l border-rose-400/30 pl-5">
						<strong class="text-white/85">Not attention auction by default.</strong>
						Extractive ranking without consent is not Market under this lens.
					</li>
					<li class="border-l border-rose-400/30 pl-5">
						<strong class="text-white/85">Not identical with Price or Exchange.</strong>
						Those are Interactive acts and signals; Market is the Collective field in which many of them cohere.
					</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="px-8 py-16 border-b border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02]">
			<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-6 text-white/60 leading-relaxed">
				<div class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[4px] text-white/40">Engineering</div>
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">What we work on</h2>
				<ul class="space-y-5 text-lg">
					<li class="border-l border-white/15 pl-5">
						<strong class="text-white/85">Keep Markets discoverable</strong> without forcing a single currency or controller.
					</li>
					<li class="border-l border-white/15 pl-5">
						<strong class="text-white/85">Preserve Ownership and Refusal-of-Control</strong> inside high-volume Exchange fields.
					</li>
					<li class="border-l border-white/15 pl-5">
						<strong class="text-white/85">Make Price signals legible</strong> enough for Opportunity comparison, without turning them into prestige games.
					</li>
					<li class="border-l border-white/15 pl-5">
						<strong class="text-white/85">Allow exit and membrane tightening</strong> so Identities are not trapped by the field.
					</li>
				</ul>

				<div class="mt-10 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-black/30 p-6">
					<div class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[3px] text-white/40 mb-3">Quick self-check</div>
					<ul class="space-y-3 text-white/60 leading-relaxed">
						<li>Whose Ownership is actually respected in this allocation field?</li>
						<li>Are Prices legible as opportunity signals, or only as status?</li>
						<li>Can an Identity exit or tighten membrane without losing Stem coherence?</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="px-8 py-16">
			<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-6 text-white/55 leading-relaxed">
				<div class="rounded-2xl border border-cyan-400/20 bg-cyan-400/[0.04] p-6 text-base">
					<div class="mb-2 text-sm uppercase tracking-[3px] text-cyan-300/80">Related</div>
					<p>
						Prior: <a href="/framework/exchange" class="text-white/85 underline decoration-white/25 hover:decoration-white/50">Exchange</a> → <a href="/framework/price" class="text-white/85 underline decoration-white/25 hover:decoration-white/50">Price</a>.
						Next: <a href="/framework/competition" class="text-white/85 underline decoration-white/25 hover:decoration-white/50">Competition</a> → Specialization.
						Physics parallel: Space and Collective persistence.
						Biology parallel: Multicellularity and shared metabolic fields.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 pt-4">
					<a href="/framework/price" class="px-6 py-3 rounded-full border border-white/20 text-white/70 hover:bg-white/5 transition">Price</a>
					<a href="/framework/competition" class="px-6 py-3 rounded-full border border-white/20 text-white/70 hover:bg-white/5 transition">Competition</a>
					<a href="/framework" class="px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-white text-black font-medium hover:bg-white/90 transition">Framework</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>
</Layout>
